      "cooked": "<p>I have created a purchase receipt with 3 items and for only one item I have enabled the check box of\" quality inspection required before purchase\"  in the Item master doctype.</p>\n<p>and when I initiate the quality inspection process, the software creates inspections for all 3 items in the table, why is that so?</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/b/a/baaed80dd653eab690deb61c06a355687b1cda91.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/baaed80dd653eab690deb61c06a355687b1cda91\" title=\"Screenshot from 2023-02-17 10-49-28\"><img src=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/b/a/baaed80dd653eab690deb61c06a355687b1cda91_2_690x399.png\" alt=\"Screenshot from 2023-02-17 10-49-28\" data-base62-sha1=\"qDtptJTLY0EBqhFPTlAtna2zZaF\" width=\"690\" height=\"399\" srcset=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/b/a/baaed80dd653eab690deb61c06a355687b1cda91_2_690x399.png, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/optimized/3X/b/a/baaed80dd653eab690deb61c06a355687b1cda91_2_1035x598.png 1.5x, https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/b/a/baaed80dd653eab690deb61c06a355687b1cda91.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"999DA0\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Screenshot from 2023-02-17 10-49-28</span><span class=\"informations\">1125×652 49.3 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div></p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/original/3X/2/8/28db340703d8055620df35c5c11f103bbc187a25.png\" data-download-href=\"https://discuss.frappe.io/uploads/default/28db340703d8055620df35c5c11f103bbc187a25\" title=\"Screenshot from 2023-02-