      "id": 458520,
      "username": "YogeshJoshi",
      "name": "Yogesh Joshi",
      "created_at": "2025-02-22T06:39:33.295Z",
      "cooked": "<p>You can update to latest version of ERPNext where they do populate all items in dialogue box but while creating Quality Inspection it throws error to remove the item for which Quality Inspection is not enabled. If you want to check the code which controls this behavior it is available in erpnext/erpnext/public/js/controllers/transaction.js and python file is in erpnext/erpnext/controllers/stock_controller.py</p>",
